%% seawolf-missile-game-init_v002_20260915.mermaid
%% Version .002 — 2026-09-15
%% Verified against Seawolf(1).asm from cartridge header through INITIALIZE_GAME.
graph TD
    classDef system fill:#1f2937,stroke:#374151,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef cartridge fill:#065f46,stroke:#047857,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef upi fill:#7c2d12,stroke:#9a3412,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;

    START([Astrocade system/menu]):::system --> Header[Cartridge header at $2000<br>"U" + two menu records]:::cartridge
    Header --> Menu[System menu presents<br>SEAWOLF / MISSILE]:::system

    Menu -->|Select SEAWOLF| SW_Entry[START_SEAWOLF $2031]:::cartridge
    Menu -->|Select MISSILE| MS_Entry[START_MISSILE $200D]:::cartridge

    SW_Entry --> Init1[CALL INITIALIZE_GAME $204E]:::cartridge
    MS_Entry --> Init2[CALL INITIALIZE_GAME $204E]:::cartridge

    Init1 & Init2 --> Prompt[SYSSUK GETPAR<br>prompt "TIME" into GAME_PARAMETER_BUFFER]:::upi
    Prompt --> SaveTime[DI; load time into GTSECS<br>preserve stack/context]:::cartridge
    SaveTime --> Context[SYSTEM INTPC<br>create interpreter context]:::upi
    Context --> Video[DO SETOUT<br>VERBL / HORCB / INMOD]:::upi
    Video --> ClearRAM[DO FILL<br>$4000-$4D97 = 0]:::upi
    ClearRAM --> ClearPatterns[DO FILL<br>PLAYER_PATTERN_PTR area = 0]:::upi
    ClearPatterns --> ClearCounters[DO FILL<br>CNT-$4FE2 = 0]:::upi
    ClearCounters --> Defaults[SET spawn counts<br>A=1, B=2; CNT=$1B01<br>INTERRUPT_PHASE=$AAAA; GAMSTB=1]:::cartridge
    Defaults --> ExitContext[DONT XINTC]:::upi
    ExitContext --> IM2[Set I=$23<br>INFBK=$10<br>IM 2]:::cartridge
    IM2 --> ReturnInit[RET to selected game entry]:::cartridge

    ReturnInit -->|SEAWOLF| SWSetup[SEAWOLF setup:<br>VOLC=$20; INTPC; COLSET SEAWOLF palette;<br>SETW submarine pattern]:::cartridge
    ReturnInit -->|MISSILE| MSSetup[MISSILE setup:<br>INTPC; SETB GAME_FLAGS=$40;<br>SETW launcher pattern; COLSET Missile palette;<br>FILL $4B90-$4C57 with $FF]:::cartridge

    SWSetup --> SWLoop[SEAWOLF_EVENT_LOOP $2042]:::cartridge
    MSSetup --> MSLoop[MISSILE_EVENT_LOOP $2025]:::cartridge
